247	    /**
248	     * Derives an owner's fiscal year, formatted {@code FY<YY>} where {@code YY} is the last two
249	     * digits (zero-padded) of the fiscal year that the owner's business-day-adjusted registration
250	     * date falls in. The fiscal year starts on 1 July and is labelled by the calendar year in which
251	     * it ends, so a registration date on or after 1 July belongs to the next year's fiscal year
252	     * (e.g. {@code 2026-08-11 -> FY27}, {@code 2026-01-05 -> FY26}).
